#: irkick.cpp:89
msgid ""
"The infrared system has severed its connection. Remote controls are no "
"longer available."
msgstr ""
"Dat Infrarootsysteem hett sien Verbinnen trennt. Feernbedeners sünd nich "
"mehr verföögbor."

#: irkick.cpp:98
msgid ""
"A connection to the infrared system has been made. Remote controls may now "
"be available."
msgstr ""
"Verbinnen na't Infraroot-Systeem is opstellt. Feernbedeners laat sik nu "
"bruken."

#: irkick.cpp:120
msgid ""
"Should the Infrared Remote Control server start automatically when you begin "
"KDE?"
msgstr "Schall de Infraroot-Feernbedeen-Deenst automaatsch mit KDE starten?"

